  "notes": [
    "Regular -AR verb, no exceptions",
    "Past participle: *intentado* (regular)",
    "Always followed by an infinitive: *intentar + infinitive* — *intenté hablar con él* (I tried to speak to him)",
    "Compare with *tratar de + infinitive* (same meaning) and *probar* (to try/taste something)",
    "Related: *el intento* (the attempt), *intentona* (failed/rash attempt)"
